      "writtenOn": "2017-10-12T04:14:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The chipset task sets this GPIO low in POWER_S3S5, so there is no guarantee it will be high throughout detect_or_power_down_ic(). And, I don\u0027t think CHIPSET_STATE_ANY_OFF includes POWER_S3S5, so it may be possible in theory (probably not in practice) for GPIO_EN_PP5000 to be incorrectly left on, going to S5 / G3.\n\nMaybe we should add some chipset-level code to synchronize this, basically allow either of two tasks to request this GPIO be turned on, and turn it off only when both tasks don\u0027t set the request.",
